##################################################################################
#
#  FILE THAT CONTAINS CHECKED ATOMIC FUZZY COLOR SPACE with VORONOI PARTITION
#  YOU CAN EDIT THIS FILE ACCORDING TO THIS SPECIFICATION:
#      1- Color space name. It must start with @name
#      2- Color space description. It must start with @description
#      3- fuzzy color space type: It must start with @fuzzyColorSpaceType
#              int value. See static variables in FuzzyColorSpaceFileManager class
#      4- crisp color space type: It must start with @crispColorSpaceType
#              int value. See static variables in ColorSpaceJMR class
#      5-reference domain: It must start with @reference
#              minX 	 maxX 	 minY 	 maxY 	 minZ 	 maxZ
#      6- lambda1 value: It must start with @lambda1.
#           Lambda1 is in [0,1] and corresponds with the core size. If lambda1 is 0.75, core size is a 0.75 fuzzy color volume size. If lambda1 is 1, core and support are equal than fuzzy color volume.
#      7- lambda2 value: It must start with @lambda2.
#           Lambda1 is in [1,2] and corresponds with the support size.
#      8- partition: It must start with @partition.
#              boolean value. 
#      9- disjoint: It must start with @disjoint.
#              boolean value. 
#      10- covering: It must start with @covering.
#              boolean value. 
#      11- Number of samples in non-covering space: s. It must start with @samples
#              int value. 
#      12- Number of colors in the fuzzy color space: c. It must start with @numberOfColors
#              int value. 
#      13- For each fuzzy color 'fc':
#           13.1- label \t X \t Y \t Z \t boolean (label, representative point and boolean in the case of sampling color).
#           13.2- Number of negative prototypes for the fuzzy color 'fc': np. It must start with @numberOfNegatives
#                  int value. 
#              for each negative prototype of 'fc':
#                   13.2.1- X \t Y \t Z 
#           13.3- Number of faces for this color: f
#              for each face 'f': 
#                13.3.1 (@Core)
#                  13.3.1.1- Plane in format A \t B \t C \t D 
#                  13.3.1.2- number of vertex for this face: v.
#                   for each vertex 'v':
#                     13.3.1.2.v- Vertex point in format X \t Y \t Z 
#                13.3.2 (@Voronoi partition)
#                  13.3.2.1- Plane in format A \t B \t C \t D 
#                  13.3.2.2- number of vertex for this face: v.
#                   for each vertex 'v':
#                     13.3.2.2.v- Vertex point in format X \t Y \t Z 
#                13.3.3 (@Support)
#                  13.3.3.1- Plane in format A \t B \t C \t D 
#                  13.3.3.2- number of vertex for this face: v.
#                   for each vertex 'v':
#                     13.3.3.2.v- Vertex point in format X \t Y \t Z 
#
#
#  Created by SoTiLLo
#
##################################################################################
